<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-071-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.387961" lon="-120.893602"><name>SC26-071-A</name><cmt>SC26-071</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 11.0 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 75/100; not catch probability. Center 85 ft; nearby 74–113 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-052</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.389002516533765" lon="-120.89384993590217"/><trkpt lat="35.38864208644722" lon="-120.8938593099572"/><trkpt lat="35.38874754340114" lon="-120.89473725260946"/><trkpt lat="35.38812254459804" lon="-120.89508375494563"/><trkpt lat="35.38785989263769" lon="-120.89553091971842"/><trkpt lat="35.387589569731404" lon="-120.89553794437022"/><trkpt lat="35.38675750306087" lon="-120.89434865325347"/><trkpt lat="35.386826500585116" lon="-120.89313594586551"/><trkpt lat="35.38745149359297" lon="-120.89278943484454"/><trkpt lat="35.38744189238372" lon="-120.89223926541361"/><trkpt lat="35.38762018672284" lon="-120.89212454091168"/><trkpt lat="35.38761442445729" lon="-120.891794438676"/><trkpt lat="35.38788474671096" lon="-120.89178740152761"/><trkpt lat="35.3878809046618" lon="-120.89156733268928"/><trkpt lat="35.388151226863